{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible then approach, check, take, task, move and drop, otherwise scan or wander. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = WanderAround    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
